{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pulls/1059","id":3406282901,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQ35BQ87LB8CV","html_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pull/1059","diff_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pull/1059.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pull/1059.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/1059","number":1059,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: add Radio Jammer enemy that blocks player active items (Issue #1036)","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nImplements the Radio Jammer enemy from Issue #1036:\n\n- **New enemy type** (`RadioJammerEnemy.tscn`): extends the base `Enemy.tscn` with `is_radio_jammer = true` and `jammer_radius = 1000`. Has a `RadioWaveEffect` child node showing animated expanding rings.\n- **Jamming mechanic**: while alive, the jammer enemy checks the player distance every physics frame. If the player is within 1000 px, it calls `ActiveItemManager.set_jammed(true)`. On death the jam is released immediately.\n- **Player blocking**: all 6 active-item input handlers (`flashlight`, `homing bullets`, `BFF pendant`, `invisibility suit`, `force field`, `trajectory glasses`) return early when `ActiveItemManager.is_active_item_jammed()` is true. Hold-type items (flashlight, force field) are also forcibly deactivated.\n- **Visual effect** (`radio_wave_effect.gd`): semi-transparent cyan rings that spawn at 10 px radius, expand to 60 px at 40 px/s, fade from opaque to transparent, and respawn every 0.5 s.\n- **20 unit tests** in `test_radio_jammer_enemy.gd` covering jammer state, proximity logic, and visual effect constants.\n\n## Changes\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `scripts/objects/enemy.gd` | Add `is_radio_jammer`, `jammer_radius` exports; `_update_jammer_effect()`; death cleanup; `get_is_radio_jammer()` |\n| `scripts/autoload/active_item_manager.gd` | Add `_is_jammed`, `set_jammed()`, `is_active_item_jammed()` |\n| `scripts/characters/player.gd` | Jammer guard in all 6 `_handle_*_input()` functions |\n| `scripts/effects/radio_wave_effect.gd` | New: animated ring visual effect |\n| `scenes/objects/RadioJammerEnemy.tscn` | New: jammer enemy scene |\n| `tests/unit/test_radio_jammer_enemy.gd` | New: 20 unit tests |\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Place a `RadioJammerEnemy` in a level and verify Space-key items cannot be activated when within 1000 px\n- [ ] Move away past 1000 px and verify items work again\n- [ ] Kill the jammer and verify items immediately work\n- [ ] Verify animated rings are visible around the jammer enemy\n- [ ] Run `test_radio_jammer_enemy.gd` via GUT — all 20 tests should pass\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n\nFixes Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP#1036","created_at":"2026-03-16T20:23:54Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T09:36:13Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3d946fb87a143474f533b7abdaecfaea94f37783","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"htt